# Two pulleys and an open belt: each belt run is tangent to both pulleys, ending on them.
circle drive r 25 at 0,0
circle driven r 12 at 110,0
fix drive.center
line upper from 2.95,24.83 to 111.42,11.92
line lower from 2.95,-24.83 to 111.42,-11.92
on upper.start drive
on upper.end driven
on lower.start drive
on lower.end driven
tangent upper drive
tangent upper driven
tangent lower drive
tangent lower driven
